oth residential and commercial interiors, including homes, offices, showrooms, retail spaces and other business environments.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do you provide support from planning to implementation?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, as a top interior design firm we provide end-to-end support, starting from initial planning and design development through material selection and implementation.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Why Choose Us (Checklist) --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1100px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list li strong {\n            display: block;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            padding: 40px 0;    \n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 12px 36px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Top Interior Design Firm in Gurgaon</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Choosing the Best Interior Design Company for Functional and Stylish Spaces</h2>\n            <p>Interior spaces should be comfortable and functional and should react to the needs and personality of the users. Top <b>interior design Firm in Gurgaon</b> offers services to assist home and business owners in crafting a unique living space that is not only beautiful but also practical. For all types of spaces such as homes, offices, showrooms, and commercial places. You must have the right materials for the interior space, proper use of space and well-defined directions.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Best Interior Designers Smart, Functional &amp; Personalized Spaces</h2>\n            <p>For a top interior design firm, good design begins with understanding. It starts with you – your needs, your lifestyle, your business goals, the space you have available and the style you prefer. Here's how to make interiors attractive and functional.</p>\n            <p>If you are looking for <b>the best interior designers in Gurgaon</b>, we make sure our designs are smart in layout, comfortable in spaces, well-lit and detailed keeping in mind the purpose of each room. As a <b>top interior design firm in Gurgaon</b>, we also suggest designs based on the needs of each client.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Interior Designing of Residential Buildings</h3>\n                <p>Home should be personal, comfortable and user friendly. We design living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, dining rooms, closets and any other space based on family requirements, furniture setup, storage, colours, lighting and materials for optimum space utilisation.</p>\n                <p>Our <b>residential interior designers in Gurgaon</b> know how to create stylish and personalised spaces without compromising on practical requirements.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Commercial and Office Interiors</h3>\n                <p>Businesses need design that helps them do their work and makes a good impression on other people. As a top interior design firm, we do commercial interiors like offices, co-working spaces, retail spaces, showrooms etc.</p>\n                <p>It’s about movement, collaboration, customer experience and brand recognition in the design. Searching for <b>Commercial Interior Designers in Gurgaon/Gurugram</b>? We focus on functional spaces that feel structured and welcoming.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Upscale &amp; Luxury Interiors</h3>\n                <p>We create sophisticated interiors with fine finishes, furniture, lighting and décor for clients who want a sophisticated look. The design is inspired by the character of the space, not by one style.</p>\n                <p>Our work as a <b>top interior design firm in Gurgaon</b> ensures comfort, visual balance and practical planning to create interiors that look distinctive and well thought out.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Space Planning &amp; 3D Visualisation</h3>\n                <p>Space planning is the best use of any property. Before we do anything, we think about where the furniture is going to go, how it’s going to move, how it’s going to be stored, how it’s going to be lit and how it’s going to connect with other rooms.</p>\n                <p>Like every top interior design firm, we let clients see the proposed design with 3D visualisation before any work begins. It can display layouts, colours, furniture, lighting and other details. This makes the plan easier to review and allows changes to be made early.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Ninth Corner for Interior Design in Gurgaon?</h2>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Personalized Design Approach</strong>\n                    Designs based on lifestyle, space and project requirements.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Residential &amp; Commercial Expertise</strong>\n                    Interiors for homes, offices, showrooms, retail and other commercial spaces.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>3D Visualization</strong>\n                    Review layouts, furniture, colours and lighting before implementation.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Space Planning</strong>\n                    Furniture movement, storage, lighting and circulation are considered during planning.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>End-to-End Support</strong>\n                    Assistance from initial planning through implementation.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Attention to Materials &amp; Finishes</strong>\n                    Selection based on appearance, functionality and project requirements.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        \n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Gurgaon</h2>\n                <p>Showcasing our completed residential and commercial spaces designed with excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                                        <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/final-a.avif\" alt=\"Top interior design firm in Gurgaon: luxury residential project by Ninth Corner\" title=\"Luxury Residential Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/hannu-office/dsc-2864.avif\" alt=\"Corporate office interior project in Gurgaon by Ninth Corner\" title=\"Corporate &amp; Commercial Space\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                    